<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMX Corp downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMX Corp downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said analyst Thomas Berquist downgraded AMX Corp to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited company statement that it expects a first quarter loss of $0.04 to $0.06 a share due to continuing losses at the company's new PHAST subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- &quot;without the PHAST losses, net earnings per share would likely be in the $0.05 area, in line with out $0.06 estimate,&quot; a Piper summary report said.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 1-39/64 to 6-9/64.</p>
</text>
